Keep a shared first as empty text.
Place "abcd" into first.
Keep a shared second as empty text.
Place "abcde" into second.
Keep a shared leftcount as 0.
Keep a shared rightcount as 0.

To countleft from spot (a whole number).
Set leftcount to 0.
For every mark from 0 to the last position of first.
If character mark of first is character spot of second, add 1 to leftcount.

To countright from spot (a whole number).
Set rightcount to 0.
For every mark from 0 to the last position of second.
If character mark of second is character spot of second, add 1 to rightcount.

The answer is empty text.
For every spot from 0 to the last position of second.
Countleft from spot.
Countright from spot.
If leftcount is less than rightcount, set answer to the slice of second from spot to one more than spot, break.

Show answer.
